桌宠，桌宠，你别馋，过了腊八就是年。\n腊八粥，过几天， 漓漓拉拉二十三。\n二十三，糖瓜粘， 二十四，扫房子，\n二十五，做豆腐， 二十六，炖猪肉，\n二十七，宰年鸡， 二十八，把面发，\n二十九，蒸馒头， 三十晚上熬一宿，\n大年初一扭一扭， 除夕的饺子年年有。#Desktop pet, desktop pet, don't drool, once Laba passes, New Year is near!\nLaba porridge first, then the 23rd arrives.\nOn the 23rd offer malt sugar, on the 24th sweep the house.\nOn the 25th make tofu, on the 26th stew pork.\nOn the 27th kill the New Year chicken, on the 28th let the dough rise.\nOn the 29th steam buns, on the 30th stay up all night.\nOn New Year's Day we dance around, and on New Year's Eve we eat dumplings year round!:|
